{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9Mosaic of the Pharaohs is <strong>digital cross-stitch</strong>. A meditative game about completing a single <strong>enormous</strong> 60,000+ piece grid puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca3 If you know how to play minesweeper, you already know how to play a mosaic puzzle! The numbered clues (0-9) indicate how many light tiles must be placed within 1 square of the clue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Piece together a breathtaking <strong>60,000-tile</strong> collage of the wonders of Ancient Egypt, uncovering nearly\u00a0<strong>100 fascinating facts</strong> about its myths, gods, monuments, explorers and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Whether you're engrossed in your favourite podcasts or listening to your favourite tunes, Mosaic of The Pharaohs serves as the perfect backdrop to enhance your experience. Or choose from the soothing built-in egyptian soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Dozens of Hours of Addictive Gameplay: Get ready to lose yourself in hours of simple, calming but addictive puzzle-solving, with 99 achievements to collect!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Land of the God Kings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530670/3abce710c4b66e74a928de6434ea7f576f7e8290.jpg"},{"name":"Pyramids of Giza","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530670/ce90f314bf63bcf1005df7f448e19fb37a63dd82.jpg"},{"name":"The Sphinx","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530670/c052f9aa7d98432f21152fa85320c99ffae4efdb.jpg"},{"name":"Temple of Karnak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530670/87b4a8a677eeb89876a6bfdf9a2966df8d6d53c8.jpg"},{"name":"Temple of Abu Simbe